<!-- STRAIGHT ANSWERS -->
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Straight answers</h2>

    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Is this cryptocurrency?</h3>
        <div>
          <p>Zero cryptocurrency. Zero tokens. Zero blockchain. Ever.</p>
          <p>The name means something older. Web 1, you read. Web 2, you posted and somebody else kept it. Web 3 is the idea that what you make, you own. That’s the whole of it, and it’s why everything I build lands in a Drive with your organization’s name on it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>What happens if I stop?</h3>
        <p>You walk away with everything. Every file, every account, every password, all of it already in your organization’s name. One email ends the arrangement, and the work stays yours.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>What do you need from me?</h3>
        <p>Two hours a week and your honest opinion. You talk, I take it from there. Friday you look over what came out and tell me what to fix.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Why three thousand a month?</h3>
        <p>You’re buying a standing appointment with one person, and a finished thing every week. I keep the number of clients small so each one gets real attention. I have room for one more.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

